<div class="p-body te-page">
<section class="p-overviewCard" aria-label="Overview"><div class="p-overviewCard__inner"><h2 class="p-overviewCard__eyebrow" data-reveal-body>Overview</h2><p class="p-overviewCard__bodyBig" data-fill data-reveal-body>An eDM design and HTML coding project for Tanium Korea&#x27;s security newsletters, product introduction emails, and event invitation and thank-you emails. Working from copy and plans provided by Tanium, we organized and supplemented the information readers needed to see first in each email, and composed key visuals and layouts that bring the weight of each security topic to the opening screen.</p><div class="p-overviewCard__layout"><div class="p-overviewCard__left"><div class="p-overviewCard__desc"><p class="p-overviewCard__subTitle" data-reveal-body>Tanium Korea 2026 — Security Newsletter, Product &amp; Event eDM</p><div class="p-overviewMetaGrid"><div class="p-overviewMetaItem" data-reveal-body><span class="p-overviewMetaLabel">Client</span><span class="p-overviewMetaValue">Tanium Korea</span></div><div class="p-overviewMetaItem" data-reveal-body><span class="p-overviewMetaLabel">Date</span><span class="p-overviewMetaValue">2026</span></div><div class="p-overviewMetaItem" data-reveal-body><span class="p-overviewMetaLabel">Type</span><span class="p-overviewMetaValue">eDM Design · HTML</span></div><div class="p-overviewMetaItem" data-reveal-body><span class="p-overviewMetaLabel">Role</span><span class="p-overviewMetaValue">eDM Design · HTML Coding</span></div></div></div></div><div class="p-overviewCard__brand" data-reveal-body><span class="p-overviewCard__brandText"><img class="p-overviewCard__brandLogo" src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/logo_tanium.svg" width="152" height="27" alt="Tanium logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="te-s1"><header class="te-head te-head--split"><div><p class="te-eyebrow" data-te-enter>Newsletter · 04.16</p><h2 data-te-enter><span class="te-titleLine">Security threats revealed</span><br /><span class="te-titleLine">on a newsletter&#x27;s first screen</span></h2></div><p class="te-desc" data-fill>A newsletter about security threats has to convey the weight of the problem on its first screen, before any long explanation. A large headline and key visual introduce the threat, while info cards explain the features and a flow diagram traces the leak path, making even complex content easy to follow in order.</p></header><div class="te-assembleScene" data-te-assemble><div class="te-assembleStage"><div class="te-mobilePieceLabel" aria-hidden="true"><span>01 First Screen</span><span>02 Feature Cards</span><span>03 Leak Path</span><span>04 Checklist</span><span>05 Contact &amp; Footer</span></div><div class="te-assembleCanvas"><figure class="te-piece"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/piece_0416_1.jpg" width="1400" height="1828" alt="First Screen" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><b>01 First Screen</b><p>A face dissolving into dots, so the risk of invisible AI comes across at first glance</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="te-piece"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/piece_0416_2.jpg" width="1400" height="1082" alt="Feature Cards" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><b>02 Feature Cards</b><p>Each unfamiliar feature paired with an image and a short line, so the three read as distinct</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="te-piece"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/piece_0416_3.jpg" width="1400" height="1188" alt="Leak Path" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><b>03 Leak Path</b><p>A three-step flow tracing how a trusted tool becomes a path for leaks</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="te-piece"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/piece_0416_4.jpg" width="1400" height="452" alt="Checklist" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><b>04 Checklist</b><p>A checklist that turns the topic into checks readers can run in their own environment</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="te-piece"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/piece_0416_5.jpg" width="1400" height="760" alt="Contact &amp; Footer" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><b>05 Contact &amp; Footer</b><p>A speech-bubble checklist that leads straight into the contact section</p></figcaption></figure><div class="te-endCaption"><span>01</span><b>First Screen</b><p>A face dissolving into dots, so the risk of invisible AI comes across at first glance</p></div><div class="te-endCaption"><span>02</span><b>Feature Cards</b><p>Each unfamiliar feature paired with an image and a short line, so the three read as distinct</p></div><div class="te-endCaption"><span>03</span><b>Leak Path</b><p>A three-step flow tracing how a trusted tool becomes a path for leaks</p></div><div class="te-endCaption"><span>04</span><b>Checklist</b><p>A checklist that turns the topic into checks readers can run in their own environment</p></div><div class="te-endCaption"><span>05</span><b>Contact &amp; Footer</b><p>A speech-bubble checklist that leads straight into the contact section</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="te-s2"><header class="te-head te-head--center"><div><p class="te-eyebrow" data-te-enter>Newsletter · 04.29 · 05.28</p><h2 data-te-enter><span class="te-titleLine">Key visuals and charts</span><br /><span class="te-titleLine">drawn anew for every topic</span></h2></div><p class="te-desc" data-fill>Each email covers a different security topic, with key visuals and charts created specifically for that topic. The first screen, info cards, and buttons follow the newsletter format, while every email stays clearly distinct in the threat it covers.</p></header><div class="te-twin"><div class="te-twinCol"><div class="te-mail"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_0429_a.jpg" width="1400" height="3636" alt="Newsletter · 0429" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_0429_b.jpg" width="1400" height="3636" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /></div><div class="te-twinCaption" data-y="330"><span>04.29</span><p>A band highlighting July 2026, when the list goes public, to give readers a reason to read now</p></div><div class="te-twinCaption" data-y="2880"><span>04.29</span><p>The five-day PoV broken down day by day, so readers can gauge the process before signing up</p></div></div><div class="te-twinCol"><div class="te-mail"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_0528_a.jpg" width="1400" height="2984" alt="Newsletter · 0528" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_0528_b.jpg" width="1400" height="2984" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_0528_c.jpg" width="1400" height="2982" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /></div><div class="te-twinCaption" data-y="800"><span>05.28</span><p>Disclosures, detection accuracy and hours instead of weeks, set as large figures that read before the text</p></div><div class="te-twinCaption" data-y="1085"><span>05.28</span><p>Time from CVE disclosure to a working exploit, 72 hours versus a few hours, felt through bar length</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="te-s2p"><header class="te-head te-head--stack"><div><p class="te-eyebrow" data-te-enter>Manuscript to Mail · 05.28</p><h2 data-te-enter><span class="te-titleLine">Numbers and procedures,</span><br /><span class="te-titleLine">charted to read at a glance</span></h2></div><p class="te-desc" data-fill>So that numerical gaps and procedures would not get lost in long sentences, the figures, comparisons, and process steps from Tanium&#x27;s copy became cards, bars, and a step diagram. Each type of information takes a distinct visual form, making values easy to compare and steps easy to follow at a glance.</p></header><div class="te-manuscriptScene" data-te-manuscript><div class="te-manuscriptStage"><div class="te-manuscriptCanvas"><div class="te-paper"><div class="te-paperLabel">Copy · provided by Tanium</div><div class="te-paperBlock"><span>①</span><p>1,596<br />Mythos 취약점 공개건수 (5월22일)<span class="te-paperSecondary">(전체 23,091 건중 검증된 일부만 공개)</span><br />90.8 %<br />Mythos 취약점 탐지 정확도<span class="te-paperSecondary">(외부 보안 회사 검증 기반)</span><br />수 시간<br />전문가 수주 작업을 AI가 대체</p></div><div class="te-ellipsis">…</div><div class="te-paperBlock"><span>②</span><p>CVE 공개 → 익스플로잇 완성 소요 시간 비교<br />LOG4SHELL 2021<br /><span class="te-paperSecondary">취약점 분석 수일 &gt; 코드 개발 수주 &gt; 무기화 수주<br /></span>72시간<br />MYTHOS 2026<br /><span class="te-paperSecondary">취약점 분석 수분 &gt; 코드 생성 수시간 &gt; 무기화 수시간<br /></span>수 시간</p></div><div class="te-ellipsis">…</div><div class="te-paperBlock"><span>③</span><p>취약점 공지부터 결과 확인까지 8단계 수동 프로세스. <span class="te-paperSecondary">사람이 티켓을 열기도 전에 AI는 공격을 완성합니다.</span><span class="te-paperShort" aria-hidden="true">…</span><br />STEP 1 취약점 공지 · STEP 2 담당자 확인 · STEP 3 영향 자산 파악 · STEP 4 변경 요청 · STEP 5 승인 · STEP 6 패치 계획 수립 · STEP 7 패치 · STEP 8 결과 확인</p></div></div><div class="te-blocks"><figure class="te-block"><figcaption>① Three lines of figures in the copy → Number cards</figcaption><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/block_0528_numbers.jpg" width="1400" height="400" alt="① Three lines of figures in the copy → Number cards" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /></figure><figure class="te-block"><figcaption>② Time comparison → Comparison bars</figcaption><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/block_0528_bars.jpg" width="1400" height="450" alt="② Time comparison → Comparison bars" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /></figure><figure class="te-block"><figcaption>③ The 8-step manual process → An eight-step diagram</figcaption><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/block_0528_steps.jpg" width="1400" height="450" alt="③ The 8-step manual process → An eight-step diagram" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /></figure></div><svg class="te-connectors" aria-hidden="true"><g></g></svg></div></div></div></section>
<div class="te-band"><div class="te-bandTrack"><span>Security Newsletter <span>·</span> Product eDM <span>·</span> Event eDM <span>·</span> </span><span aria-hidden="true">Security Newsletter <span>·</span> Product eDM <span>·</span> Event eDM <span>·</span> </span></div></div>
<section class="te-s3"><header class="te-head te-head--right"><div><p class="te-eyebrow" data-te-enter>Product eDM · 10.21</p><h2 data-te-enter><span class="te-titleLine">A product introduction email</span><br /><span class="te-titleLine">that opens with a single question</span></h2></div><p class="te-desc" data-fill>The Tanium Atlas email turns the copy&#x27;s question, &quot;Were we affected?&quot;, into an alert and an input field on its first screen. The body is organized into four steps — question, reasoning, approval, resolution — so readers follow the product as it works its way to an answer.</p></header><div class="te-readerScene" data-te-reader><div class="te-readerStage"><div class="te-app"><div class="te-appBar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="te-appBody"><div class="te-inbox"><div class="te-inboxRow"><span class="te-avatar">T</span><div><b>Tanium Korea</b><strong>공격은 수 시간, 대응은 며칠?</strong><small>&quot;우리도 영향받았나?&quot; AI가 답합니다</small></div></div><div class="te-inboxRow"><span class="te-avatar">T</span><div><b>Tanium Korea</b><strong>취약점 하나가 터지면, 전수 조사에…</strong><small>단말 취약성 컴플라이언스 관리</small></div></div><div class="te-inboxRow"><span class="te-avatar">T</span><div><b>Tanium Korea</b><strong>사라진 병목</strong><small>AI 시대 패치 관리 패러다임의 전환</small></div></div><div class="te-inboxRow"><span class="te-avatar">T</span><div><b>Tanium Korea</b><strong>AI는 이미 수천 개의 제로데이를…</strong><small>2026년 7월, 그 목록이 공개됩니다</small></div></div><div class="te-inboxRow"><span class="te-avatar">T</span><div><b>Tanium Korea</b><strong>보이지 않는 AI, 가장 큰 보안 리스크</strong><small>로컬 LLM, IDE 확장 기능…</small></div></div></div><div class="te-reading"><div class="te-readingHead"><strong>공격은 수 시간, 대응은 며칠? "우리도 영향받았나?" AI가 답합니다</strong><div class="te-sender"><span class="te-avatar"></span><div><b>Tanium Korea</b><small>To: me</small></div></div></div><div class="te-readerViewport"><div class="te-mail"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_1021_a.jpg" width="1400" height="3155" alt="Tanium Atlas · 10.21" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_1021_b.jpg" width="1400" height="3155" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /></div><div class="te-readerHighlight" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="te-readerCards"><div class="te-readerCard"><span>01 / 04</span><p>An alert and a question field that show, at first glance, a product you can simply ask</p></div><div class="te-readerCard"><span>02 / 04</span><p>A question over a late-night work scene, so readers can picture themselves in it</p></div><div class="te-readerCard"><span>03 / 04</span><p>An unfamiliar AI process split into four rows — question, reasoning, approval, resolution — to follow in order</p></div><div class="te-readerCard"><span>04 / 04</span><p>Videos and use-case cards that walk through the product before the Tanium Atlas introduction</p></div><div class="te-readerDots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="te-s3b"><div class="te-followup"><div class="te-followupText"><header class="te-head te-head--stack"><div><p class="te-eyebrow" data-te-enter>Product eDM · 09.18</p><h2 data-te-enter><span class="te-titleLine">Audit times side by side</span><br /><span class="te-titleLine">in a follow-up email</span></h2></div><p class="te-desc" data-fill>This follow-up to an IT exhibition for Jeju local governments had to tell public-sector staff how long a full asset audit takes and which capabilities help. Under a question headline on a red top banner, the customer case from the copy — 71 days versus 1 day — sits in a side-by-side comparison, so readers see the time gap first and then move on to the related features.</p></header><div class="te-crops"><figure class="te-cropCard" data-te-enter style="--i:0"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/crop_0918_first.jpg" width="1050" height="656" alt="An opening screen with a question headline on a red banner" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><span>01</span><p>A question headline that brings up the days a full asset audit can take, right at the top</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="te-cropCard" data-te-enter style="--i:1"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/crop_0918_compare.jpg" width="1050" height="375" alt="Audit time compared side by side: 71 days next to 1 day" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><span>02</span><p>71 days and 1 day side by side, so the gap reads without explanation</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="te-cropCard" data-te-enter style="--i:2"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/crop_0918_features.jpg" width="1050" height="596" alt="Cards for vulnerability and compliance assessment, and file change monitoring" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><span>03</span><p>Assessment and change-monitoring features split into cards, so readers can start with what they need</p></figcaption></figure><figure class="te-cropCard" data-te-enter style="--i:3"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/crop_0918_button.jpg" width="1050" height="135" alt="The &quot;Learn more&quot; button" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><figcaption><span>04</span><p>A &quot;Learn more&quot; button placed after the comparison and features, leading on to the details</p></figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="te-followupMail"><div class="te-mail"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_0918_a.jpg" width="1400" height="2044" alt="Product eDM · 09.18" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mail_0918_b.jpg" width="1400" height="2044" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"  /></div></div></div></section>
<section class="te-s4"><header class="te-head te-head--center"><h2 data-te-enter><span class="te-titleLine">Newsletter and product emails</span><br /><span class="te-titleLine">opened in an inbox</span></h2></header><figure class="te-mock"><img src="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mockup_inbox.jpg" width="2880" height="1620" alt="The 04.16 newsletter open in a laptop inbox and the 10.21 product email on a phone, on a sunlit desk" loading="lazy" decoding="async" srcset="/assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mockup_inbox_1440.jpg 1440w, /assets/images/projects/tanium_edm/mockup_inbox.jpg 2880w" sizes="(max-width:768px) 100vw, 88vw" /></figure></section>
